                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 457].</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Colonel Stewart to
                        Sir H. D. Wolff.</hi></head>
                <p>The Armenian who wounded Mrs. Wright has been seized and imprisoned by the
                    governor of Salmas. The lady is a little better.</p>
